            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>The record button in the header is smaller, so it sits lighter next to the title instead of dominating the top bar.</li>
<li>Corrected the screen-video card wording: your screen video appears after you finish recording, not live while you record.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
